WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
There is a future, right? Captain Han, my brother asked me to ask

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:05,200
We want to buy a batch of purifying clothes, okay? Can we go back and give them to you?

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,120
One weighs ten pounds

4
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,720
Give me one hundred and ten purification clothes and bring five thousand kilograms of rice

5
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,200
I need food now

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,120
I'll send someone back to the base right away. No need to send someone, I'll make the arrangements myself.

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,320
Fast and safe

8
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,090
How to arrange

9
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,210
drone

10
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:34,310
Damn you still have a drone

11
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,630
Where did Lu Qiyan find it?

12
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:37,630
You're such a good baby

13
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:38,950
There is only one checking system

14
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,750
Drone system can be purchased all the time

15
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,710
Just the points Yuetu sent me today

16
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:45,170
It’s enough for me to exchange for thirty drones

17
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,530
Base strength

18
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,610
Stronger again
